{"about_the_game":"The game has more than 18 different characters representing many different professions for you to choose from. Including the robot faction and the horror mutant faction in the toilet. Each character has different quirky attacks that create CRAZY, funny and dramatic battles.<br />\r\nThe match can start alone or play online with at least 2 players, up to 10 players<br />\r\n*** Outstanding features ***<br />\r\n- Characters have balanced strength, balanced upgrades and accumulate resources throughout the game. There is no element of paying to buy upgrade resources, so everything is very balanced, winning or losing depends on your skills<br />\r\n- Fight online with friends<br />\r\n- Play alone or team up with 2 to 10 players together<br />\r\n- Tactical PVP<br />\r\n- Fight with characters with different strengths and unique attack skills<br />\r\n- Many battle maps, vivid and fun sounds","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3548010?t=1742266845","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3548010?t=1742266845","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548010/70864560829e38a83e932d3917da131e30a80f87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742266845","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548010/70864560829e38a83e932d3917da131e30a80f87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742266845","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"The game has more than 18 different characters representing many different professions for you to choose from. Including the robot faction and the horror mutant faction in the toilet. Each character has differe